ory\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, same as September to October. In 2025 the middle got 49% of normal in October to November and 36% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 35% of normal on the middle. Grid 18795 had its driest year in 2007 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
